<?xml version="1.0" ?>
<AUTOSAR xmlns="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0 AUTOSAR_00046.xsd">
  <ADMIN-DATA>
    <DOC-REVISIONS>
      <DOC-REVISION>
        <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
        <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
      </DOC-REVISION>
    </DOC-REVISIONS>
  </ADMIN-DATA>
  <AR-PACKAGES>
    <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:AUTOSAR">
      <SHORT-NAME>AUTOSAR</SHORT-NAME>
      <AR-PACKAGES>
        <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:ECUCDEFS">
          <SHORT-NAME>EcucDefs</SHORT-NAME>
          <ELEMENTS>
            <ECUC-MODULE-DEF UUID="ECUC:a72ca44c-5093-4cd1-b6f1-e197d31fdd75">
              <SHORT-NAME>Dem</SHORT-NAME>
              <DESC>
                <L-2 L="EN">Configuration of the Dem (Diagnostic Event Manager) module.</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：Dem（Diagnostic Event Manager）是AUTOSAR中负责管理诊断事件的模块，它记录和报告故障码（DTCs），并支持故障诊断的相关过程。</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置Dem时，需确保故障码的唯一性和与ISO 14229标准的一致性；配置参数应满足项目的诊断策略要求；在多ECU系统中，还需考虑故障码的系统级一致性和网络管理需求。</L-2>
              </DESC>
              <ADMIN-DATA>
                <DOC-REVISIONS>
                  <DOC-REVISION>
                    <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
                    <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
                  </DOC-REVISION>
                </DOC-REVISIONS>
              </ADMIN-DATA>
              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00928</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>
              <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
              </SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
              <CONTAINERS>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:e85440ff-d0a6-4001-bcfc-aa36b340c94a">
                  <SHORT-NAME>DemConfigSet</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration parameters and sub containers of the Dem module supporting multiple configuration sets.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemConfigSet 是用于定义诊断事件管理（Diagnostic Event Manager）模块中所有配置集的容器，它包含了用于车辆诊断的所有配置参数。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，每个DemConfigSet必须唯一且对应于特定的诊断需求；配置集应包含所有必要的诊断事件、操作周期和存储条件；在多配置集系统中，需确保正确的配置集被激活以匹配当前的车辆操作模式。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00634</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:0e021851-052b-4857-94c4-5552aa563311">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemComponent</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container configures the monitored components and system dependencies.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemComponent配置项用于定义诊断事件管理（Diagnostic Event Manager）中的组件，它将特定的诊断事件与软件组件关联起来，以便于对故障进行分组和管理。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemComponent时，需要确保每个诊断事件只关联到一个组件，以避免管理上的混淆；组件的命名应当遵循项目规范，以便于识别和维护；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，DemComponent的属性和结构应符合规范定义，任何偏离都需要特别注意并进行调整。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00904</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:364d67b8-ea17-4074-8605-104ef108e358">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemComponentIgnoresPriority</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This configuration switch defines, whether the priority of events at this component shall be ignored.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemComponentIgnoresPriority 是一个配置项，用于指定诊断事件管理（DEM）组件是否忽略事件的优先级设置，这可能影响事件的处理和存储。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，通常事件的优先级是由系统设计者根据诊断需求来设定的；如果设置了DemComponentIgnoresPriority为true，则意味着所有事件将被视为同等优先级，这可能会导致高优先级事件得不到应有的快速响应；在配置此项时，应仔细考虑系统的诊断策略和实际需求，以避免潜在的问题。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00905</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:54316525-84ea-4bbd-a904-2ad08a86db7c">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemComponentFailedCallbackFnc</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Specifies the function to be called on component failed status changes.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemComponentFailedCallbackFnc 是一个配置项，用于定义在诊断事件管理（DEM）中，当某个组件检测到故障时调用的回调函数。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保回调函数符合实时性要求和资源限制；回调函数应避免执行复杂或耗时的操作，以免影响系统性能；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，此配置项应正确映射到相应的故障处理逻辑。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00906</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                            <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                          </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                        </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF>
                        <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:7242bd9b-d09d-424b-a7c1-0128b05099cd">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemComponentFailedCallbackUsePort</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Specifies whether CBStatusComp_{ComponentName} for component change notifications shall be provided.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemComponentFailedCallbackUsePort 是一个配置项，用于指定是否通过一个端口接口来使用组件失败回调函数，这样可以在故障诊断管理模块（Dem）中通知相关组件关于特定故障的状态变化。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，需要确保如果启用了该配置项，相应的端口接口和回调函数必须在系统中得到正确定义和实现；此配置项的使用应与系统设计和诊断策略紧密相关，确保故障处理逻辑的一致性；在配置时应注意与其他诊断相关配置项的兼容性和整体诊断架构的一致性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00947</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                            <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-CONDITIONAL>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                            </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-CONDITIONAL>
                          </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                        </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:be963f71-031e-439b-b083-1e55bb5b189a">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemComponentId</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Unique identifier of a DemComponent.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemComponentId是用于标识诊断事件管理（Diagnostic Event Manager）中的组件标识符，它为每个组件分配一个唯一的标识符，用于诊断事件的分类和管理。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：组件标识符必须在整个系统中唯一，以避免诊断信息的混淆；在配置时应参照AUTOSAR规范中定义的标识符分配规则；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，对DemComponentId的具体格式和范围有明确规定，需要确保遵守这些规定以保证兼容性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">Component Id  should be configured in sequential order beginning with 1 and no gaps in between.
                                                This parameter should not be changeable by user, because the Id should be generated by Dem itself to prevent gaps and multiple use of an Id</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00930</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>65535</MAX>
                          <MIN>1</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:7503b23c-0f04-4af8-894e-e6bc07cd2e1b">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemImmediateChildComponentRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Reference to all immediate children of the current component.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemImmediateChildComponentRef 配置项用于引用诊断事件管理器（DEM）中的子组件，这些子组件与立即存储事件相关联，以便在发生故障时能够迅速响应。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemImmediateChildComponentRef时，需要确保引用的子组件在DEM配置中存在且有效；此配置项通常与故障诊断相关的数据结构和处理逻辑紧密相关；在设计和配置时，应考虑系统的诊断策略和故障处理流程。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00907</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dem/DemConfigSet/DemComponent</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                      </REFERENCES>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:e956d461-86fc-4de4-9aaf-db59e14f31d1">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemDTC</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) for DemUdsDTC.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">(0, TypeError(&quot;'AssertionError' object is not subscriptable&quot;))</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00886</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>65535</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:ec5f19c2-2f59-4a05-a5a7-21fc4e8b49e3">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemDTCSeverity</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">DTC severity according to ISO 14229-1. This parameter depends on the automotive manufacturer.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDTCSeverity 配置项用于定义诊断故障代码（DTC）的严重程度，这有助于车辆维修技术人员确定故障的优先级和处理策略。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，确保每个DTC都有一个明确的严重程度级别；严重程度的定义应符合国际标准或制造商的规定；不正确的严重程度配置可能会导致诊断系统的误导或错误优先级判断。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">If it is not configured, the value is counted as 'no severity'.
                                                If this parameter is configured for no DTC, the Dem provides no DTC severity information.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00645</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>DEM_SEVERITY_NO_SEVERITY</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                          <LITERALS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:6b84ca6f-51da-94bc-5973-9da844219d26">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DEM_SEVERITY_CHECK_AT_NEXT_HALT</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:361eefb1-9af7-975f-3434-7f1df3c3b7f2">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DEM_SEVERITY_CHECK_IMMEDIATELY</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:c4a16fb4-d3c7-9503-34ac-f8d2647b22cb">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DEM_SEVERITY_MAINTENANCE_ONLY</SHORT-NAME>
