                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:10f37378-2b66-4089-aec4-382cb9316830">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemDTCAttributes</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) for DemDTCAttributes.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDTCAttributes 配置项用于定义诊断故障码（DTC）的属性，这些属性包括DTC的值、严重性、功能单元以及故障类型等，用于故障诊断管理。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemDTCAttributes时，需要确保DTC值的唯一性，避免在系统中出现重复的故障码；严重性等级和功能单元应符合项目的诊断策略和标准；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准可能对DTC的格式和取值范围有具体要求，需要遵守这些规范。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00641</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>65535</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:13bf7d23-8cc0-4b57-8911-92658b0cb328">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemAgingAllowed</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines if a DTC can be aged.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemAgingAllowed 是一个配置项，用于指定是否允许对诊断事件（Diagnostic Event）的老化计数进行管理，即是否可以对事件进行老化处理以清除故障码。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR 4.4标准中，确保该配置项与系统的诊断需求一致；老化机制的使用应遵循相关的法规和标准；配置时应注意与DemAgingCycle和DemOperationCycle的关系和配置一致性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">TRUE: aging allowed
                                                FALSE: aging not allowed</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00622</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>true</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:73be02e4-de26-4bf9-87d8-8f6d3b15f532">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemDTCSignificance</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Significance of the event, which indicates additional information concerning fault classification and resolution.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDTCSignificance配置项用于定义诊断故障码（DTC）的重要性等级，这有助于车辆维修人员确定故障的优先级和严重性。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保为每个DTC分配正确的重要性等级，以便正确地管理故障诊断；重要性等级的选择应遵循制造商或标准化组织的指导；不正确的配置可能会导致故障管理流程中的优先级判断错误。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">It can be mapped as Dem-internal data element. It shall be configured, if it is a part of event related data.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00779</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
