                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:36762979-4f63-4424-8629-4aa724c8ffdb">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemDebounceCounterBasedClass</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration of Debounce Counter Based Class</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDebounceCounterBasedClass是用于定义基于计数器的去抖动类，在故障检测管理（Diagnostic Event Manager, DEM）中，此配置项用于指定如何通过计数器方法去抖动诊断事件。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：去抖动阈值（如增加和减少的计数器值）必须根据应用需求仔细配置，以避免过早或过晚地确认故障；在配置时需注意与其他去抖动方法（如时间延迟去抖动）的区别和适用场景；该配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中是标准的，但实现细节可能因AUTOSAR版本或供应商实现而异。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00881</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>65535</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:aa2d713a-ec74-4c4c-93a9-bd83b0c107b8">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemDebounceCounterJumpDown</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Switch for the activation of Jump-Down.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDebounceCounterJumpDown是一个用于诊断事件去抖动的配置参数，它定义了在去抖动计数器式去抖动算法中，当事件被认为不再出现时，计数器减少的步长。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该参数的值需要根据具体的系统去抖动需求来设置，以确保诊断算法的准确性和响应性；过大的跳变值可能导致去抖动过程对事件的响应过于迅速，而过小的值可能导致系统对故障的识别延迟；在设置该参数时，还需要考虑与其他去抖动参数如DemDebounceCounterJumpUp和DemDebounceCounterDecrementStep等的关系和平衡。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">true: Jump-Down activated
                                                false: Jump-Down deactivated</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00685</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:6f82b9d4-c3e1-4f00-8196-1f85c7be1562">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemDebounceCounterJumpUp</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Switch for the activation of Jump-Up.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDebounceCounterJumpUp是一个用于定义诊断事件去抖动算法中，当特定条件满足时，去抖动计数器增加的步长值的配置项。它是去抖动策略的一部分，用于快速响应故障的出现。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的值应根据系统对故障检测的灵敏度和响应速度的需求来设定；过高的值可能导致误报，过低的值可能导致故障检测的延迟；在配置时需要考虑与DemDebounceCounterBased配置的其他参数（如阈值）的协同效果。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">true: Jump-Up activated
                                                false: Jump-Up deactivated</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00686</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:33babe76-7e6b-44dc-8233-e33933cf87e7">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemDebounceCounterStorage</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Switch to store the debounce counter value non-volatile or not.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDebounceCounterStorage 配置项用于定义诊断事件去抖动计数器的存储策略，决定去抖动计数器在断电后是否保持其值。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，去抖动计数器的存储策略需要与系统的诊断需求相匹配；如果需要在断电后保持去抖动状态，应选择非易失性存储；配置时应确保存储资源的可靠性和足够的写入周期。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">true: debounce counter value shall be stored non-volatile
                                                false: debounce counter value is volatile</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00791</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:6fd7cbcb-976b-46c5-bd9c-2ac97686f52d">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemDebounceBehavior</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines how the event debounce algorithm will behave, if a related enable condition is not fulfilled or ControlDTCSetting of the related event is disabled.</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00786</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>DEM_DEBOUNCE_RESET</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                          <LITERALS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:16e06174-75b1-88fc-269d-07756688aa22">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DEM_DEBOUNCE_FREEZE</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:83a4b1c1-3dfd-8716-2de9-b8f14217427f">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DEM_DEBOUNCE_RESET</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                          </LITERALS>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:c03b4aa0-c57a-439c-8516-f0ba483c8d33">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemCounterBasedFdcThresholdStorageValue</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Threshold to allocate an event memory entry and to capture the Freeze Frame.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemCounterBasedFdcThresholdStorageValue 用于定义故障检测计数器（FDC）的阈值，该阈值决定何时将故障信息存储到非易失性存储器中。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该值应根据系统的故障管理策略和容错需求设定；过低的阈值可能导致频繁的存储操作，影响系统性能和存储器寿命；确保该配置与系统的诊断需求一致。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00914</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>32767</MAX>
                          <MIN>1</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:07c58e53-a31c-421d-a6eb-910f2d3cd2d8">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemDebounceCounterDecrementStepSize</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines the step size for decrementation of the internal debounce counter (PREPASSED).</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDebounceCounterDecrementStepSize 是用于定义诊断事件去抖动算法中，计数器去抖动策略的递减步长，即每次评估周期计数器减少的值。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该参数的设置需要根据具体的系统去抖动需求来配置，以确保故障诊断的准确性和响应时间；递减步长不应该设置得过大，以避免过快地降低故障指示，导致可能的故障被遗漏；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，该配置项应与其他去抖动参数协同工作，确保去抖动逻辑的有效性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00635</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>32768</MAX>
                          <MIN>1</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:aff278be-3537-4099-8858-212582caf8f2">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemDebounceCounterFailedThreshold</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines the value of the internal debounce counter, which indicates the failed status.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDebounceCounterFailedThreshold 是用于定义诊断事件去抖动算法中，计数器式去抖动策略的失败阈值，即当计数器达到此阈值时，诊断事件被认为是失败的。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该阈值必须是正整数；去抖动策略的选择应当与系统的故障检测机制相匹配；在配置时应确保阈值与DemDebounceCounterPassedThreshold（通过阈值）之间有合理的间隔，以避免频繁的状态切换。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00618</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>32767</MAX>
                          <MIN>1</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:7cde5c15-c87f-4eed-b0f5-38313a32efe2">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemDebounceCounterIncrementStepSize</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines the step size for incrementation of the internal debounce counter (PREFAILED).</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDebounceCounterIncrementStepSize 用于定义诊断事件去抖动计数器的增量步长，该参数决定了每次事件触发时，去抖动计数器增加的数值。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该参数的设置应根据系统的误报率和漏报率需求进行调整；过大的步长可能导致系统对故障的响应过于敏感，而过小的步长可能导致响应迟缓；需与DemDebounceCounterDecrementStepSize配合使用，以实现有效的去抖动效果。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00637</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>32767</MAX>
                          <MIN>1</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:7baa87e8-87d0-45bb-9937-a8c3a4ebc2b6">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemDebounceCounterJumpDownValue</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Jump-Down value of the internal debounce counter which is taken as initialization value for the counter when the respective step-down occurs.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDebounceCounterJumpDownValue 是一个用于定义诊断事件去抖动算法中，当事件不再满足故障条件时，去抖动计数器减少的值。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该值通常与DemDebounceCounterJumpUpValue（事件满足故障条件时，去抖动计数器增加的值）相对应；需要确保该值的设置能够正确反映系统的去抖动需求，避免过于敏感或迟钝的去抖动行为；在配置该值时，应考虑与其他去抖动参数的协同效应，以实现预期的诊断性能。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00638</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>0</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                          <MAX>32767</MAX>
                          <MIN>-32768</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:86693810-0a0a-4927-91ae-5d3723761724">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemDebounceCounterJumpUpValue</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Jump-Up value of the internal debounce counter which is taken as initialization value for the counter when the respective step-up occurs.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDebounceCounterJumpUpValue定义了在计数防抖算法中，当某个事件被认为是活跃的，其对应的防抖计数器应该增加的值。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该值必须是正整数；配置时需考虑事件的敏感度和系统对错误识别的容忍度；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，确保与其他防抖参数协同工作，以达到预期的防抖效果。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00639</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>0</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                          <MAX>32767</MAX>
                          <MIN>-32768</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2c4aba4f-9fc9-4572-a226-9562516ffac3">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemDebounceCounterPassedThreshold</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines the value of the internal debounce counter, which indicates the passed status.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDebounceCounterPassedThreshold 是用于定义诊断事件去抖动算法中，事件被认为是已通过（Passed）的计数器阈值。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该阈值应当与DemDebounceCounterFailedThreshold一起配置，以确保去抖动算法能够正确区分事件状态；阈值必须是非负整数；在配置时应考虑事件的特性和系统的诊断策略。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00636</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>-1</MAX>
                          <MIN>-32768</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:978e87ff-eaf2-4a92-9ed8-479f57b7816c">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemDebounceTimeBaseClass</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration of Debounce Time Based Class.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDebounceTimeBaseClass 是用于定义诊断事件去抖动算法中时间基准类的配置项，它决定了去抖动时间参数的计量单位和范围。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置去抖动算法时，需要确保时间基准类与实际的去抖动需求相匹配；去抖动时间参数的选择应考虑系统的实时性和诊断精度；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应遵循相关模块的规范来配置去抖动时间基准类。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00882</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>65535</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:79236e41-97f0-418c-b2f2-241d6595589b">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemDebounceBehavior</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines how the event debounce algorithm will</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDebounceBehavior 配置项用于定义诊断事件去抖动算法的行为，它决定了事件在被认定为故障前需要满足的去抖动条件。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保选择的去抖动算法与系统需求相匹配；去抖动参数需要根据具体应用场景仔细调整，以避免过早或过晚地诊断出故障；去抖动行为的配置应与故障检测策略和系统的可靠性目标保持一致。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">behave, if a related enable condition is not fulfilled or ControlDTCSetting of the related event is disabled.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00789</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
