                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:fc68bc01-d147-4b6d-95a2-36cfa577cacf">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemOperationCycleRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Kind of operation cycle for the event (e.g. power cycle, driving cycle, ...)</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemOperationCycleRef 是一个配置项，用于引用诊断事件管理（DEM）中的操作周期，该周期定义了诊断事件（如故障码）的生命周期和状态变化。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保引用的操作周期在DEM配置中已定义；操作周期的选择应与诊断事件的预期行为相匹配；在配置时要注意操作周期的启动和停止条件，以确保正确的故障码管理。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00702</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC V1.0.0</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dem/DemGeneral/DemOperationCycle</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:92052d72-8af4-4f08-9d1f-2a901238caf9">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemStorageConditionGroupRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">References a storage condition group.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemStorageConditionGroupRef 是一个配置项，用于引用一个存储条件组，该组定义了一组存储条件，这些条件决定了诊断事件（DTC）是否应该被存储。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemStorageConditionGroupRef时，需要确保引用的存储条件组已经在系统中定义；存储条件组的配置应该与诊断需求相匹配，以确保正确的DTC存储逻辑；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，存储条件的使用和配置应遵循标准规定的格式和约束。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00769</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
