                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:92052d72-8af4-4f08-9d1f-2a901238caf9">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemOsApplicationRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">References the OsApplication used for Dem satellite.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemOsApplicationRef用于指定诊断事件管理（DEM）模块中，与操作系统应用程序的关联引用，确保DEM可以正确地与特定的OS应用程序交互。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemOsApplicationRef时，必须确保引用的OS应用程序已经定义在系统中；此配置项对于实现DEM模块与操作系统之间的隔离和交互至关重要；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保引用的正确性和有效性是必须的，以避免运行时错误。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00770</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
