                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                      </REFERENCES>
                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        <ECUC-CHOICE-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:98a5d79e-8975-48e4-bbc8-a174596e2dbb">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemDebounceAlgorithmClass</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Debounce algorithm class: counter based, time based, or monitor internal.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDebounceAlgorithmClass 配置项用于定义诊断事件去抖动算法的类别，这决定了如何评估和处理诊断事件的稳定性和瞬态行为。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，去抖动算法类别需要与实际实现的去抖动策略相匹配；去抖动算法的选择应当基于系统的诊断需求和性能考量；配置错误的去抖动算法可能导致诊断事件的错误评估或处理。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00604</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <CHOICES>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:c20d7e84-9b93-4776-a3db-24113379f5f4">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DemDebounceCounterBased</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) for counter based debouncing.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDebounceCounterBased配置项用于定义基于计数器的去抖动策略，适用于诊断事件去抖动处理，通过计数器增减值来确定诊断事件的状态。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：去抖动阈值需根据实际应用场景谨慎设置，以避免过早或过晚触发诊断事件；在配置时需注意与其他去抖动策略（如时间基去抖动）的选择和应用场景的匹配；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于去抖动参数有明确的定义和要求，确保配置符合标准规范。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00711</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <REFERENCES>
                                <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:9e4d9110-f44a-4580-a035-75653981215a">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DemDebounceCounterBasedClassRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This reference selects the DemDebounceCounterBasedClass applied for the debouncing of the DemEventParameter.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDebounceCounterBasedClassRef是一个配置项，用于引用基于计数器的消抖动类，该类定义了错误诊断事件的消抖动策略，包括计数器增加或减少的条件和阈值。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保引用的消抖动类存在且正确定义了所有必要的参数，如阈值和步长；此配置项对于实现基于计数器的消抖动机制至关重要，错误配置可能导致诊断事件的错误识别或延迟；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对消抖动策略有详细规定，需确保配置符合标准要求。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00883</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dem/DemConfigSet/DemDebounceCounterBasedClass</DESTINATION-REF>
                                </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                              </REFERENCES>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:cc0801d6-d390-4989-80bf-e5bf1d2832b6">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DemDebounceMonitorInternal</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) for monitor internal debouncing.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDebounceMonitorInternal配置项用于定义诊断事件去抖动算法中，基于内部变量监控的去抖动参数，这些参数用于确定故障的存在与否。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保去抖动算法与系统需求相匹配；去抖动参数必须根据具体的应用场景进行精确配置，以避免错误的故障检测；去抖动策略的选择应考虑系统的性能和资源限制。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00712</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:82f362d0-6c6f-47ea-b760-c561850bcfa2">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DemCallbackGetFDC</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">DemCallbackGetFDC specifies the callback (parameter DemCallbackGetFDCFnc is present) or R-Port (no parameter DemCallbackGetFDCFnc is present) to retrieve the fault detection counter value.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemCallbackGetFDC是一个配置项，用于定义诊断事件管理（DEM）模块中，获取故障检测计数器（FDC）的回调函数。该回调函数允许用户自定义如何获取特定诊断事件的FDC值。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保回调函数符合DEM模块的接口要求；回调函数的实现需要保证线程安全，以适应多任务环境；该配置项的使用应结合具体的诊断需求和系统架构进行设计。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">In case no container is configured, no fault detection counter will be available.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00630</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:fc99fc77-96af-446e-9167-2db5d56b6f50">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DemCallbackGetFDCFnc</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines the name of the function that the Dem will call to retrieve the fault-detection counter value from a complex driver.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemCallbackGetFDCFnc是一个配置项，用于定义诊断事件管理器（DEM）中，获取故障检测计数器（FDC）的回调函数。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保回调函数符合DEM模块的接口规范；回调函数需要能够返回正确的故障检测计数器值；在配置时，应注意与DEM事件ID的正确关联。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00631</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                        <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                                      </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                    </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF>
                                  </PARAMETERS>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                              </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:498c5d2e-12d2-43c7-8892-9bb11701a6aa">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DemDebounceTimeBase</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) for time based debouncing.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDebounceTimeBase配置项用于定义诊断事件去抖动算法中的时间基准，这是确定诊断事件状态变化前需要等待的时间长度。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：去抖动时间基准必须与系统的实时性要求相匹配，避免设置过长导致诊断响应延迟；去抖动算法的选择和配置应根据具体应用场景谨慎进行；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保该配置项与所选去抖动算法兼容。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00713</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <REFERENCES>
                                <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:08da8485-0447-4bcf-a38b-895bec3240d6">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DemDebounceTimeBaseRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This reference selects the DemDebounceTimeBaseClass applied for the debouncing of the DemEventParameter.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDebounceTimeBaseRef 是一个配置项，用于引用基准时间，该时间用于故障诊断管理（Diagnostic Event Manager, DEM）中的去抖动算法，以确定故障的状态。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置去抖动算法时，必须确保引用的基准时间与实际的系统时钟或计时器相匹配；去抖动时间基准的选择应该考虑系统的实时性要求和故障检测的灵敏度；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保DemDebounceTimeBaseRef的引用对象存在且配置正确，以避免运行时错误。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00891</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dem/DemConfigSet/DemDebounceTimeBaseClass</DESTINATION-REF>
                                </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                              </REFERENCES>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                          </CHOICES>
                        </ECUC-CHOICE-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:81830ba7-c118-43dd-baf9-d89bcec71b90">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemCallbackClearEventAllowed</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">The presence of this container indicates that the Dem has access to a &quot;ClearEventAllowed&quot; callback.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemCallbackClearEventAllowed是一个配置项，用于定义是否允许在特定情况下清除诊断事件。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，需要确保此配置项正确反映了系统对诊断事件管理的需求；不当的配置可能导致诊断信息丢失或错误处理；此配置项的使用应遵循相关的诊断策略和安全要求。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">In case there is a DemCallbackClearEventAllowedFnc, this parameter defines the name of the function that the Dem will call.

                                                In case there is no DemCallbackClearEventAllowedFnc, the Dem will have an R-Port requiring the interface CallbackClearEventAllowed whose name is generated by using the unique callback-prefix followed by the event name.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00607</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:7411934a-7525-44dd-b02b-e0681e08b4c2">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DemClearEventAllowedBehavior</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Defines the resulting UDS status byte for the related event, which must not be cleared according to the ClearEventAllowed callback.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemClearEventAllowedBehavior配置项定义了诊断事件（Diagnostic Event）清除操作的允许行为，指定了在何种情况下可以清除特定的诊断故障码（DTC）。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的设置必须符合车辆制造商的诊断策略和法规要求；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，需确保配置与Dem管理策略一致；不当的配置可能导致无法清除DTC或违反诊断通信标准。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00788</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>DEM_NO_STATUS_BYTE_CHANGE</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                              <LITERALS>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:fcbbe3da-65c8-93a4-4d21-04949539cced">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DEM_NO_STATUS_BYTE_CHANGE</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:c86d9fde-c4ac-8940-7643-d40958c6ef49">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DEM_ONLY_THIS_CYCLE_AND_READINESS</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                              </LITERALS>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:f57a2f55-06b0-438d-9a41-d2626089d446">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DemCallbackClearEventAllowedFnc</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Function name of prototype &quot;ClearEventAllowed&quot;.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemCallbackClearEventAllowedFnc是一个配置项，用于定义在清除诊断事件之前调用的回调函数，以决定是否允许清除该事件。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保回调函数符合预期的接口和行为要求；在实现时考虑事件清除的条件和逻辑，以避免不恰当地清除重要诊断信息；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中应确保与诊断事件处理流程兼容，若有特殊处理逻辑，需详细文档化。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00609</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
