                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:505d125c-04db-4d5e-92f4-d73e664f7174">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemCallbackEventUdsStatusChanged</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">The presence of this container indicates, that the Dem has access to an &quot;EventUdsStatusChanged&quot; callback, which the Dem will call to notify other components about the change in the status of an event.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemCallbackEventUdsStatusChanged 用于定义诊断事件管理（DEM）中，当UDS（统一诊断服务）状态发生变化时触发的回调函数。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保回调函数的实现遵循AUTOSAR标准中对于错误处理和通知机制的要求；在配置时需正确关联具体的诊断事件和UDS状态变化；此回调配置应避免引入额外的系统延迟或影响诊断通信效率。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">In case there is a DemCallbackEventUdsStatusChangedFnc, this parameter defines the name of the function that the Dem will call.

                                                In case there is no DemCallbackEventUdsStatusChangedFnc, the Dem will have an R-Port requiring the interface CallbackEventUdsStatusChanged, whose name is generated by using the unique callback-prefix followed by the event name.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00628</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:0a1de324-a6d1-4b23-ba12-631c41dbd8cc">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DemCallbackEventUdsStatusChangedFnc</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Function name of prototype &quot;Dem_CBEventUdsStatusChanged&quot;</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemCallbackEventUdsStatusChangedFnc是一个配置项，用于定义当诊断事件的UDS状态发生变化时，需要调用的回调函数。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保回调函数符合预期的签名和参数列表，以便正确接收和处理状态变化信息；在配置此项时，应确保相关诊断事件已正确定义和配置；此配置项的使用应遵循AUTOSAR的诊断管理模块规范，以保证兼容性和功能正确性。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00629</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
