                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:d5d553cf-6461-432d-a91f-f2c9ad1195ac">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemCallbackMonitorStatusChanged</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">The presence of this container indicates, that the Dem has access to an &quot;MonitorStatusChanged&quot; callback, which the Dem will call to notify other components about the change in the status of an event.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemCallbackMonitorStatusChanged是一个配置项，用于定义诊断事件管理（DEM）模块中，监控状态变化时所调用的回调函数。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemCallbackMonitorStatusChanged时，需要确保回调函数符合AUTOSAR标准中定义的原型和行为；回调函数应该是短暂的，不应该包含复杂的逻辑或长时间的操作，以避免影响系统性能；此外，需要确保回调函数的实现是线程安全的，特别是在多核或多任务环境中。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">In case there is a DemCallbackMonitorStatusChangedFnc, this parameter defines the name of the function that the Dem will call.

                                                In case there is no DemCallbackMonitorStatusChangedFnc, the Dem will have an R-Port requiring the interface CallbackMonitorStatusChanged, whose name is generated by using the unique callback-prefix followed by the event name.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00936</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:5b09860f-24e5-4601-bf13-55855b29bf89">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DemCallbackMonitorStatusChangedFnc</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Function name of prototype &quot;&lt;Module&gt;_DemTriggerOnMonitorStatus&quot;</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemCallbackMonitorStatusChangedFnc是一个配置项，用于定义诊断事件管理（DEM）模块中，监控状态变化时调用的回调函数。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保回调函数符合DEM模块的接口规范；回调函数需要能够处理状态变化的通知，且不应阻塞或延迟系统的其他操作；在配置时，应注意与其他回调函数的潜在依赖关系和执行顺序。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00937</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
