                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:38466ee0-81d6-4eb5-84ea-278631d94b99">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemIndicatorAttribute</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the event specific configuration of Indicators.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemIndicatorAttribute 配置项用于定义诊断事件指示器属性，它关联了故障指示灯（MIL, tell-tale等）与特定的诊断事件，用于控制指示灯的行为，如亮起、闪烁或熄灭。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemIndicatorAttribute时，需要确保指示器属性与诊断事件的映射正确无误；此外，指示器的行为应符合相关法规要求；在多指示器系统中，还需注意指示器之间的优先级和互斥逻辑。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00681</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:26582faa-e852-45d6-a68d-cf0cc279ca26">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DemIndicatorBehaviour</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Behaviour of the linked indicator</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemIndicatorBehaviour 配置项定义了诊断事件指示器的行为，指定了当相关的诊断事件发生时，车辆上的故障指示灯（MIL, Check Engine Light等）应如何响应。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemIndicatorBehaviour时，需要确保其行为与相关的诊断事件和车辆制造商的要求一致；此配置项应与车辆的法规要求相符合，例如OBD（On-Board Diagnostics）要求；在配置过程中还应注意与DemEventParameter配置项的一致性，确保指示器行为正确映射到相应的诊断事件上。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00682</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
