                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:44faa8c1-9430-4ce8-b572-a9033e48bdd5">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemPidClass</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the different PIDs for the single global OBD relevant freeze frame class. It is assembled out of one or several data elements.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemPidClass 是一个配置项，用于定义诊断事件参数标识符（PID）的类别，这些类别决定了PID在诊断通信中的行为和处理方式。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，需要确保DemPidClass的配置与诊断需求和规范一致；不同的PID类别可能对应不同的存储和传输策略；在配置时，应参照相关的诊断标准，如ISO 15031-5或ISO 14229-1，以确保兼容性和规范性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00729</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:18337b6d-c988-4e65-9896-c0814ac35f45">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemPidIdentifier</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">identifier of the PID</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemPidIdentifier 是用于诊断事件管理（Diagnostic Event Manager）中，标识特定参数标识符（Parameter Identifier, PID）的配置项，它关联了一个特定的PID到一个诊断事件。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemPidIdentifier时，必须确保PID的唯一性，避免与其他诊断事件的PID冲突；此外，PID值应符合OBD（On-Board Diagnostics）或制造商特定的诊断标准；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循相关模块的配置规范，以确保诊断功能的正确实现。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00705</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>255</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:08dbe78d-7b7b-4510-bfa9-3ce041b597d2">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemPidDataElement</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the different data elements contained in the specific PID.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemPidDataElement配置项用于定义诊断事件管理（DEM）中的参数标识符（PID）与数据元素之间的映射关系，这样在车辆诊断时可以通过PID来获取相关的故障信息。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保PID与数据元素之间的映射关系正确无误，以便于故障诊断过程中能够准确读取到故障数据；此外，每个PID应该映射到一个唯一的数据元素，避免数据冗余或混淆；在配置时还需考虑数据元素的访问权限和数据保护需求。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00896</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <REFERENCES>
                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:e55a5a69-f687-4fd6-9b48-17ca02603d1d">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DemPidDataElementClassRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This reference contains the link to a data element class.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemPidDataElementClassRef 是一个配置项，用于引用一个特定的数据元素类，该类定义了诊断事件管理器（DEM）中用于参数标识符（PID）的数据元素的属性和行为。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemPidDataElementClassRef时，必须确保引用的数据元素类在系统中已定义且有效；该配置项的正确性对于故障诊断数据的准确性和可靠性至关重要；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应遵循DEM模块的配置规则，确保与标准的兼容性。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00733</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-CHOICE-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dem/DemGeneral/DemDataElementClass</DESTINATION-REF>
                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                          </REFERENCES>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                      </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                  </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:6ca017f1-d32b-49c2-9624-9c1a628401c2">
                  <SHORT-NAME>DemGeneral</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) of the BSW Dem</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemGeneral 是 AUTOSAR诊断事件管理器（DEM）的一部分，它定义了DEM模块的全局配置参数，如版本信息和诊断监控的基本行为。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保DemGeneral中的参数设置符合项目的诊断需求；在配置时应参考AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准以确保兼容性；适当的错误处理和版本控制策略是必需的，以避免运行时错误和配置冲突。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00677</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a6dc6ad7-49e6-4cec-ba61-24237f4b9e2d">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemAgingRequiresNotFailedCycle</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Defines if the aging cycle counter is processed in operation cycles with test failed report or not.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemAgingRequiresNotFailedCycle 是一个配置项，用于确定在故障记忆单元中的故障年龄增长是否需要一个未失败的驾驶周期。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，确保此配置正确反映系统的诊断需求；错误的配置可能导致故障管理逻辑错误；此配置项对于满足某些法规要求可能是必需的。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">True: Aging cycle counter is processed only in operation cycles without test failed.
                                        False (Default): No effect on aging cycle counter processing.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00918</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a3bd8297-60fe-44db-9094-40808a08b5f4">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemAgingRequiresTestedCycle</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Defines if the aging cycle counter is processed every aging cycles or if only tested aging cycle are considered.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemAgingRequiresTestedCycle是一个配置项，用于定义诊断事件老化（Dem）机制中，一个事件在被认为是老化之前需要经过的测试周期数。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的值必须根据系统的可靠性要求和实际的诊断策略来设定；过高或过低的测试周期数可能会影响系统的诊断效率和准确性；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保该配置项与诊断事件管理策略一致。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true: only tested aging cycle are considered for aging cycle counter

                                        false: aging cycle counter is processed every aging cycle</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00877</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:306ac5ba-3e68-40cc-a248-b1bde6637e37">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemDebounceDisable</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This configuration switch defines, whether disable Dem debounce feature.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDebounceDisable是一个配置项，用于禁用诊断事件的防抖动机制，这通常意味着事件将在首次报告时立即被认为是有效的，而不经过通常的防抖动过程。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用DemDebounceDisable时，需要确保对事件的立即处理不会导致误报或系统性能问题；此配置项的使用应当谨慎，因为它可能会绕过为避免错误诊断而设计的防抖逻辑；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保此配置项的使用与系统的诊断需求一致。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true: Dem debounce feature is disabled
                                        false: Dem debounce feature is enabled</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00725</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:6d308999-a425-4904-aef3-a55c5e5db5e6">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemDebounceCounterBasedSupport</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This configuration switch defines, whether support for counter based debouncing is enabled or not.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDebounceCounterBasedSupport是一个配置项，用于确定诊断事件管理（DEM）模块是否支持基于计数器的防抖动算法，该算法用于确定诊断事件是否稳定，从而避免因临时故障或噪声导致的误报。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DEM模块时，需要根据系统的需求决定是否启用基于计数器的防抖动支持；如果启用此功能，还需要配置相关的防抖动参数，如阈值和步长；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，基于计数器的防抖动是一个可选功能，不是所有的项目都需要启用。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true: counter based debouncing support is enabled
                                        false: counter based debouncing support is disabled</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00724</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:306ac5ba-3e68-40cc-a248-b1bde6637e36">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemDebounceTimeBasedSupport</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This configuration switch defines, whether support for time based debouncing is enabled or not.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDebounceTimeBasedSupport是一个配置项，用于确定诊断事件管理（DEM）模块是否支持基于时间的消抖算法，这种算法通过时间阈值来确定故障的存在。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，需要确保如果启用了基于时间的消抖支持，相应的消抖策略和参数也应当被正确配置；如果不支持基于时间的消抖，相关的消抖策略应当禁用或配置为不使用时间作为消抖依据；此配置项的设置应与系统的诊断需求和硬件能力相匹配。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true: time based debouncing support is enabled
                                        false: time based debouncing support is disabled</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00725</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:21da3508-a0a5-4ecb-994e-b8378d8bcc8a">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemDevErrorDetect</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Switches the development error detection and notification on or off.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDevErrorDetect是一个配置参数，用于启用或禁用开发错误检测功能，在AUTOSAR诊断事件管理（Dem）模块中用于决定是否报告开发阶段的错误。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在生产代码中通常应禁用此功能以避免性能损耗；在开发和测试阶段，可以启用它以帮助识别和诊断问题；确保在最终产品中关闭此功能，以满足汽车行业的标准和规范。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">* true: detection and notification is enabled.
                                        * false: detection and notification is disabled.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00648</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:088bfcc2-3ffe-426c-9182-db21e7c3b259">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemGeneralInterfaceSupport</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">The interfaces GeneralEvtInfo, GeneralCallbackEventDataChanged, GeneralCallbackMonitorStatusChanged and GeneralCallbackEventUdsStatusChange are provided if DemGeneralInterfaceSupport is equal to true.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemGeneralInterfaceSupport配置项用于定义诊断事件管理器（DEM）与外部接口之间的支持情况，决定了DEM模块如何与其他软件组件或硬件接口进行交互。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，需确保此配置与系统中实际使用的接口兼容；若系统需求中没有特定的接口支持需求，应谨慎启用此功能以避免不必要的资源消耗；配置时应考虑与Diagnostics Communication Manager (DCM) 的交互方式和需求。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00880</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>true</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:40aaf4a3-811c-4ed4-b5ed-c364b32c4193">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemPTOSupport</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This configuration switch defines, whether PTO support (and therefore PID $1E support) is enabled or not.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemPTOSupport配置项用于指定诊断事件管理（DEM）模块是否支持Prestored Freeze Frame（PFF）数据的存储，即在故障发生前就预存储的冻结帧数据。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应确保此配置项与系统需求和诊断策略相匹配；如果不需要预存储冻结帧数据的功能，该配置项应设置为不支持以节省资源；在配置时应注意与其他诊断功能的兼容性和存储空间的优化。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">false</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00704</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:af5bbe02-f227-411a-b071-9b9a5b48bf52">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemResetConfirmedBitOnOverflow</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This configuration switch defines, whether the confirmed bit is reset or not while an event memory entry will be displaced.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemResetConfirmedBitOnOverflow 配置项用于确定当诊断事件内存溢出时，是否自动重置已确认故障的状态位。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，需要确保诊断事件管理策略与此配置项相匹配；如果系统设计要求在事件内存溢出时保留已确认故障状态，那么此配置项应设置为false；此配置项的设置会直接影响故障存储和恢复策略。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00799</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>true</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:b8232040-8309-438b-b16d-3bbf911191b0">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemStatusBitStorageTestFailed</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Activate/Deactivate the permanent storage of the &quot;TestFailed&quot; status bits.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemStatusBitStorageTestFailed 是一个配置项，用于确定诊断事件管理器（DEM）中特定事件的测试失败状态位是否应该被存储。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保该配置项与事件的故障记忆策略相匹配；存储测试失败状态位可能会影响非易失性存储器（NVM）的使用寿命，因此需要谨慎配置；在配置时要考虑与其他DEM相关配置项的兼容性和一致性。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">false</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true: storage activated
                                        false: storage deactivated</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00714</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:ffa4e7ab-5a53-4aab-89d5-faab430e6007">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemTriggerFiMReports</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Activate/Deactivate the notification to the Function Inhibition Manager.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemTriggerFiMReports配置项用于定义诊断事件管理（DEM）模块触发故障指示管理（FiM）报告的条件和行为，确保在特定的诊断事件发生时，相应的故障指示被正确报告和管理。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemTriggerFiMReports时，需确保每个诊断事件的触发条件与行为清晰定义，避免重复或遗漏；此配置项对系统的故障诊断和指示流程有重要影响，应仔细设计和测试；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对FiM的集成和配置有详细规定，需遵循标准以保证兼容性和功能正确性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true: FiM notification activated
                                        false: FiM notification deactivated</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00719</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:5fcadaa0-df21-4e86-ab87-636545aafe14">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemTriggerMonitorInitBeforeClearOk</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Defines if the monitor re-initialization has to be triggered before or after the Dem module returns DEM_CLEAR_OK.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemTriggerMonitorInitBeforeClearOk 是一个配置项，用于指定在清除诊断事件之前是否应该初始化事件监控器。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，此配置项的设置应确保与诊断事件管理策略一致；错误的配置可能会导致诊断信息的不一致或丢失；在配置时应参考具体的诊断需求和系统行为。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true: trigger re-initialization before DEM_CLEAR_OK
                                        false: trigger re-initialization after DEM_CLEAR_OK</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00765</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
