                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Os/OsApplication</DESTINATION-REF>
                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                  </REFERENCES>
                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    <ECUC-CHOICE-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:6505a151-66bd-4283-b004-9f267f7ce44e">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemDataElementClass</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) for an internal/external data element class.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDataElementClass配置项用于定义诊断事件管理器（DEM）中的数据元素类别，它指定了数据元素的类型、大小以及如何获取这些数据。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemDataElementClass时，必须确保数据类型与实际应用中的数据匹配；数据元素的大小应该符合ECU处理能力和存储限制；获取数据的方法需要保证数据的实时性和准确性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00610</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>65535</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <CHOICES>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:731531ff-e865-4793-887a-8064686ae7d1">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemExternalCSDataElementClass</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) for an external client/server based data element class.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemExternalCSDataElementClass配置项用于定义外部条件记录数据元素的类别，这些数据元素用于在诊断事件管理（DEM）中记录额外的环境数据，以便于故障诊断和分析。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，确保每个DemExternalCSDataElementClass的定义与实际应用场景相匹配；对于每个诊断事件，合理选择和配置外部条件记录数据元素以优化故障分析过程；该配置项的使用应遵循DEM模块的数据记录策略和要求。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">It defines, how the Dem can obtain the value of the data element from either a SW-C or another BSW module. Whether a client/server port or a C function-call is used, is defined by DemDataElementUsePort.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00668</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:de34ea35-3409-443b-b85a-6d8fdd12710b">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DemDataElementProvideMonitorData</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">If the parameter is set to True, the generated function call to retrieve the data element has the monitorData0 as additional first parameter.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDataElementProvideMonitorData 是一个配置项，用于指定诊断事件管理（DEM）模块中的数据元素是否提供监控数据，这些数据可用于故障诊断和系统监控。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保数据元素的监控数据提供与系统诊断需求相匹配；监控数据的更新频率和精度应满足故障检测和记录的要求；在配置数据元素时，应注意数据的封装和访问权限，以保护系统的安全性和完整性。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00951</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                            </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:9cf1ca4d-69eb-4ba4-bfbc-6e3c027526d2">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DemDataElementUsePort</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">If the parameter is set to True, a R-Port is generated, to obtain the data element (interface DataServices_{Data}).</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDataElementUsePort配置项用于定义诊断事件管理（DEM）中数据元素与端口之间的关联，指定数据元素如何通过特定的端口获取或发送信息。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，确保数据元素与正确类型的端口关联，如SenderReceiver或ClientServer端口；配置时需注意数据元素的数据类型与端口接口定义的数据类型一致；此配置项对于实现诊断数据的准确传输至关重要，应仔细配置以避免数据不一致。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">If the parameter is set to False, the information is obtained by C function-call on another BSW module specified by the parameter DemDataElementReadFnc.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00647</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>true</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                            </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:3584056b-51ee-4777-930a-51cbb794e902">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DemDataElementDataType</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Provide the implementation data type of this C/S data element.</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">UINT8</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00950</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
