                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:fa9c6503-853e-4f03-b603-dfee41f57709">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DemDataElementReadFnc</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">In case of DemDataElementUsePort is false, this parameter defines the prototype of the C function &quot;ReadDataElement&quot; used to get the according value.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDataElementReadFnc 是用于定义诊断事件管理器（DEM）中，数据元素的读取函数。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保该函数符合AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对数据读取函数的要求和格式；该函数应能正确处理数据读取时可能出现的错误，并返回适当的错误代码；在实现时应考虑数据的同步和并发访问问题。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00619</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                              </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                            </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:f661ddf1-572f-46be-878f-ae751642dfb0">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DemDataElementArraySize</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">If the data element is an array data element, it defines the number of elements in the array. Note that this is not the size in bytes.</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00949</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>4294967295</MAX>
                              <MIN>1</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:8e6c8d7e-2a1f-44a9-a5cf-728b1478f58d">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemExternalSRDataElementClass</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) for an external sender/receiver based data element class. It defines, how the Dem can obtain the value of the data element from a SW-C, by using a sender/receiver port.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemExternalSRDataElementClass 配置项用于定义诊断事件记录器中外部状态报告数据元素的属性，这些属性包括数据元素的类型、大小和存储方式。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，需要确保数据元素的类型与实际应用中的数据类型相匹配；数据元素的大小应该与其类型一致，避免数据截断或溢出；存储方式应该满足系统的性能和存储要求。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00669</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:25afee69-0327-4666-8baf-77218bb4a807">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DemDataElementDataType</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Provide the implementation data type of data belonging to a external data.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDataElementDataType 用于定义诊断事件管理器（DEM）中数据元素的数据类型，确保数据的正确处理和存储。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：必须确保数据类型与实际应用中的数据兼容；选择合适的数据类型以优化内存使用和处理速度；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，数据类型应遵循定义的数据类型模型。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00840</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
