                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                      </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:e1cbc150-3dd5-4439-abf5-ccb4cde025c7">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemDidClass</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) for a data Id class. It is assembled out of one or several data elements.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDidClass 配置项定义了诊断数据标识符（DID）的属性，这些属性包括DID的标识符、数据大小、数据类型等，用于车辆诊断通信中标识和访问特定的数据。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemDidClass时，需要确保DID的唯一性，避免与其他DID冲突；根据AUTOSAR标准，DID的数据类型和大小应与实际应用中的数据匹配；在配置DID访问权限时，应遵循相关法规和安全要求。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00706</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>65535</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:6fb72160-e0f8-4592-831c-05d34fe8c839">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemDidIdentifier</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Identifier of the Data ID.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDidIdentifier 是用于诊断事件管理（Diagnostic Event Manager, DEM）中，标识数据标识符（Data Identifier, DID）的配置项，它关联特定的诊断信息与其对应的DID。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemDidIdentifier时，需要确保DID的唯一性，避免与其他诊断服务或数据标识符冲突；DID应符合ISO 14229和车辆制造商的诊断协议要求；在配置过程中，还需注意DID与诊断信息之间的映射关系正确性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00650</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>65535</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:30a0fb20-847a-43b2-ad30-0df10d7c2f68">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemDidDataElementClassRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This reference contains the link to a data element class.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDidDataElementClassRef 是一个配置项，用于引用数据元素类，该类定义了诊断数据标识符（DID）中包含的数据元素的属性和行为。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemDidDataElementClassRef时，必须确保引用的数据元素类已经在系统中定义；引用的数据元素类应与DID的预期诊断数据一致；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保数据元素类的定义符合最新的诊断事件管理标准。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00617</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <REQUIRES-INDEX>true</REQUIRES-INDEX>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-CHOICE-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dem/DemGeneral/DemDataElementClass</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                      </REFERENCES>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:490f6445-7fad-4f11-9130-c78155a7fbe6">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemEnableCondition</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) for enable conditions.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemEnableCondition 配置项用于定义诊断事件管理（Diagnostic Event Manager）中的启用条件，这些条件控制着诊断事件（DTC）是否被监控。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemEnableCondition时，需要确保每个诊断事件与其启用条件之间的映射关系正确无误；启用条件应该与系统的实际工作状态和需求相匹配；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，启用条件的配置应遵循标准定义的属性和参数。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00653</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:7e66af51-7547-4ead-9cc8-9dd2c2f112fe">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemEnableConditionStatus</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines the initial status for enable or disable of acceptance of event reports of a diagnostic event.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemEnableConditionStatus 用于定义诊断事件管理（DEM）中启用条件的状态，控制是否启用特定的诊断功能。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保每个启用条件与其对应的诊断功能正确关联；在系统设计时考虑所有可能的启用条件状态，以避免系统在未预期的状态下运行；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，启用条件的管理和配置应严格遵循标准指南。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">The value is the initialization after power up (before this condition is reported the first time).
                                                true: acceptance of a diagnostic event enabled
                                                false: acceptance of a diagnostic event disabled</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00656</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>true</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:8941da71-f206-4351-8887-40650a034533">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemEnableConditionId</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines a unique enable condition Id.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">(1, TypeError(&quot;'AssertionError' object is not subscriptable&quot;))</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">This parameter should not be changeable by user, because the Id should be generated by Dem itself to prevent gaps and multiple use of an Id. The enable conditions should be sequentially ordered beginning with 0 and no gaps in between.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00654</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>255</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:32a02fa5-08ff-4668-b2a6-bcc8066eccd1">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemEnableConditionGroup</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) for enable condition groups.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemEnableConditionGroup配置项用于定义诊断事件管理（DEM）中的启用条件组，这些条件组决定了特定的诊断监控功能是否被激活。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemEnableConditionGroup时，必须确保每个条件组内的条件逻辑关系正确，以避免逻辑冲突；此配置项对于实现基于条件的诊断功能至关重要，应仔细设计；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对启用条件的表达和管理有明确规范，需确保配置符合标准要求。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00745</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:2efef637-5844-4dfc-984b-a96a59d045f2">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemEnableConditionRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">References an enable condition.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemEnableConditionRef用于引用启用诊断事件管理（Diagnostic Event Manager）中特定事件的条件，这有助于控制事件的启用状态。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保引用的启用条件已在系统中定义且有效；在配置时需注意与相关的诊断需求和策略的一致性；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中应与诊断事件的管理策略紧密结合，以确保正确的事件启用逻辑。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00655</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC V1.0.0</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dem/DemGeneral/DemEnableCondition</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                      </REFERENCES>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:628914e1-4e2d-4ce2-930b-ba2f6dda468b">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemEventMemorySet</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container is a collection of referenced event memories and related information for a Dem client.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemEventMemorySet配置项用于定义诊断事件内存的设置，包括事件存储的内存块和相关属性，以便在发生故障时记录和存储诊断事件信息。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemEventMemorySet时，需要确保内存块的大小和数量满足系统对诊断事件记录的需求；配置的内存块必须与ECU的物理内存资源相匹配；应遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中关于诊断事件内存管理的规范。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00939</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2e118358-e52d-474d-95d0-6a4807a3bcbf">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemTypeOfDTCSupported</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines the format returned by Dem_GetTranslationType and does not relate to/influence the supported Dem functionality.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemTypeOfDTCSupported 配置项用于指定诊断事件管理（DEM）模块支持的故障诊断代码（DTC）类型，例如发动机或传动系统的DTC。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemTypeOfDTCSupported时，需要确保所选的DTC类型与实际应用和法规要求相匹配；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准可能会限定支持的DTC类型范围，因此需要参考标准文档以确保兼容性；此外，不同的车辆制造商和市场可能有不同的DTC要求，因此配置时应考虑目标市场的特定需求。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00720</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>DEM_DTC_TRANSLATION_ISO14229_1</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                          <LITERALS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:3900f0c1-0cf5-8d79-2c4c-0c61851ff285">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DEM_DTC_TRANSLATION_ISO11992_4</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:5aecfcc6-128a-96a2-19a6-3ef27c99b838">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DEM_DTC_TRANSLATION_ISO14229_1</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:2cf6c6e0-486e-9b09-3fbf-5c8a43064d9b">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DEM_DTC_TRANSLATION_ISO15031_6</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:4bd28966-8ad3-8e88-515e-590b171e71d7">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DEM_DTC_TRANSLATION_SAEJ1939_73</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:f5094c25-43e7-910b-501d-b7fc0ca4d313">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DEM_DTC_TRANSLATION_SAE_J2012_DA_DTCFORMAT_04</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                          </LITERALS>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:4a2afd78-57fb-4c89-a156-eae8fc5dcf37">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemDtcStatusAvailabilityMask</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Mask for the supported DTC status bits by the Dem. This mask is used by UDS service 0x19.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDtcStatusAvailabilityMask配置项用于定义可用的诊断故障码（DTC）状态位掩码，这决定了哪些DTC状态信息可以被报告和存储。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该掩码应与车辆诊断策略一致，确保仅启用相关的DTC状态位；修改此配置可能会影响故障检测和报告机制；在实施时需考虑与其他诊断服务的兼容性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00652</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>255</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:cd9f6fcb-2134-4e0b-95fb-833dfca769bb">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemMaxNumberEventEntryPermanent</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Maximum number of events which can be stored in the permanent memory.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemMaxNumberEventEntryPermanent 是一个配置参数，用于定义诊断事件管理（DEM）模块中永久故障记录的最大数量，这些记录即使在故障条件不再存在时也会被保留。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该值应根据系统需求和可用存储资源来设定；过高的值可能会导致存储资源的浪费，而过低的值可能会导致重要故障信息的丢失；在设置该值时，还需要考虑到诊断法规的要求和车辆制造商的具体策略。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">The assignment of an event to this memory type is dynamic and used for emission-related events only.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00689</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>255</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:cedf27e6-b9f5-4c36-800f-eab98917ec18">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemAmberWarningLampIndicatorRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines the indicator representing the AmberWarningLamp . This parameter may be used for ECUs supporting J1939.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemAmberWarningLampIndicatorRef 配置项用于引用故障指示灯（通常是黄色或橙色警告灯）的标识符，该指示灯用于通知驾驶员车辆可能存在需要注意的问题。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemAmberWarningLampIndicatorRef时，需要确保引用的指示灯标识符在系统中是唯一的，并且已经在相应的诊断事件管理模块中定义；此外，指示灯的行为（如闪烁频率和条件）应符合相关法规和制造商的要求；在AUTOSAR环境中，应遵循标准的诊断事件管理配置流程来设置和使用该配置项。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00821</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
