                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:72faf0f3-3027-489f-9f81-a5d73effafdb">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemClearDTCNotification</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Contains callback function definition which are called during clear DTC operations.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemClearDTCNotification配置项用于定义诊断事件管理（DEM）模块在清除诊断故障码（DTC）时需要通知的回调函数，以便执行特定的清除后动作或处理。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保回调函数处理时间尽可能短，避免影响系统性能；在配置时需确保回调函数与DTC清除动作的兼容性；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，此配置项的使用应遵循DEM模块的规范要求。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00925</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:ce30a2d3-b1fe-4e98-99be-2e3357f5d644">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DemClearDtcNotificationTime</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Configure, whether the callback shall be called on start of a clear or after finishing a clear DTC operation (refer to &lt;Module&gt;_ClearDtcNotification)</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemClearDtcNotificationTime配置项用于定义诊断事件管理（DEM）模块在清除诊断故障码（DTC）后，通知应用软件的时间。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，该配置项的时间值应当符合ECU的实时性要求；需要确保该时间参数与ECU的诊断策略和应用软件的处理能力相匹配；在配置时，应参考相关的诊断通信标准，如ISO 14229（UDS），以确保符合行业规范。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00927</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <LITERALS>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:fd61767a-4d8a-9762-46e0-d32615727e05">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>FINISH</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:7e25aa5f-3dc0-8f56-3ed8-04e7aa010a02">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>START</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                              </LITERALS>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:9e8465c1-2a57-4753-907f-9cc066fd6f1a">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DemClearDtcNotificationFnc</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Notification callback function name which is called on a clear DTC operation (refer to &lt;Module&gt;_ClearDtcNotification).</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemClearDtcNotificationFnc是一个配置项，用于定义在诊断事件管理（Diagnostic Event Manager, DEM）中，当特定的诊断故障码（Diagnostic Trouble Code, DTC）被清除时，需要调用的通知函数。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置此项时，确保所引用的函数符合AUTOSAR标准中对通知函数的要求，包括函数的参数和返回类型；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中可能需要与其他DEM配置项协同工作，确保整体配置的一致性；在实际应用中，需要注意该通知函数的执行时间，避免影响系统性能。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00926</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                              </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                            </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:3d9ac4b7-4eb9-4ac6-b433-30b5b6fa9fe9">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemIndicator</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) for Indicators.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemIndicator配置项用于定义故障指示器（如仪表盘上的警告灯）的行为，包括它如何响应特定的故障诊断事件（DTC）。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemIndicator时，需确保其与故障诊断事件的映射关系正确无误；考虑故障指示器的优先级，以便在多个故障同时存在时正确显示；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准要求故障指示器的行为应可配置，包括但不限于故障灯的闪烁频率和持续时间。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00680</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:7b5c78d8-ffb6-478c-a521-a8ebfeb21b00">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DemIndicatorID</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Unique identifier of an indicator.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemIndicatorID是用于标识诊断事件管理（DEM）中特定指示器的唯一标识符，它关联了故障指示灯（MIL）或其他用户界面元素与特定的诊断故障码（DTC）。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemIndicatorID时，确保每个指示器ID在系统中是唯一的；指示器ID应与实际的物理或虚拟指示器元素相对应；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，指示器的管理和配置需要遵循DEM模块的规范要求。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00683</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>255</MAX>
                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:84c00d3e-0326-465a-a624-8ecbf5513d11">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemMirrorMemory</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the mirror event memory specific parameters of the Dem module.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemMirrorMemory 是用于定义诊断事件内存镜像的配置项，它允许在主诊断事件内存（PrimaryMemory）出现故障时，将诊断事件信息暂存到一个备用的内存区域。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemMirrorMemory时，需要确保系统中有足够的备用内存空间来存储镜像信息；此外，应当注意备用内存的可靠性和访问速度，以确保在主内存出现问题时能够顺利切换；最后，需要根据AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准正确配置镜像内存的大小和管理策略，以保证其符合诊断需求。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00902</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:884c0df3-c917-44ef-adf6-a7d6f4638e20">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DemMaxNumberEventEntryMirror</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Maximum number of events which can be stored in the mirror memory</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemMaxNumberEventEntryMirror配置项定义了镜像内存中可以存储的最大诊断事件条目数，用于在主存储区域损坏时保留诊断信息。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该值应根据系统可用内存和诊断需求谨慎配置，以避免内存溢出；镜像存储区域的大小和配置应与主存储区域相协调，确保关键诊断信息的保留；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中未明确指定该配置项的默认值，需要根据具体实现和应用需求设定。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00688</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>255</MAX>
                              <MIN>1</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:a2b003e7-7872-46cc-87e2-fd828f2b62b1">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemPrimaryMemory</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the primary event memory specific parameters of the Dem module.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemPrimaryMemory 配置项用于定义诊断事件管理器（Diagnostic Event Manager）中的主要存储区域，该区域用于存储发生的诊断故障码（DTC）和相关数据，直到它们被清除或转移到次要存储区域。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemPrimaryMemory时，需要确保存储空间足够以存储预期数量的DTC和相关数据；考虑到非易失性存储器（NVM）的写入周期和耐久性，应合理规划DTC的存储策略；此外，AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准可能对主存储区域的最大容量、存储格式或管理策略有特定要求，需要遵守这些要求以确保兼容性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00901</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:541d8100-8ad8-9290-286c-fe1dab4cbe93">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DemEnvironmentDataCapture</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">DemEnvironmentDataCapture defines the point in time, when the data actually is captured.</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">DEM_CAPTURE_ASYNCHRONOUS_TO_REPORTING</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00895</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
