                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <LITERALS>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:5b6a112e-64c3-dc9d-dd6c-24493d41e5e9">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DEM_FF_RECNUM_CALCULATED</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:36c9422b-c8e9-e605-1a41-e76148bc9093">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DEM_FF_RECNUM_CONFIGURED</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                              </LITERALS>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:29cb4d86-003f-4d93-9e59-7105edd601f4">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DemMaxNumberEventEntryUserDefined</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Maximum number of events which can be stored in the user defined memory.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemMaxNumberEventEntryUserDefined 是用于定义用户自定义事件条目的最大数量，这个配置项指定了诊断事件管理器（DEM）中可以存储的用户定义事件的最大数目。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保此数值满足系统的诊断需求，同时不超过ECU的资源限制；此配置项的值应该与实际的诊断事件数量相匹配，避免资源浪费；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，如果该值设置得过大，可能会导致内存分配问题，因此需要仔细评估。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00691</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>255</MAX>
                              <MIN>1</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:9d50f228-cce8-4c85-b820-1be229c85383">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DemUserDefinedMemoryIdentifier</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Identifier used by external tester to identify the User defined event memory.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemUserDefinedMemoryIdentifier 是一个配置项，用于定义诊断事件管理器（DEM）中用户自定义的内存标识符，这些标识符用于区分不同的诊断信息存储区域。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemUserDefinedMemoryIdentifier时，需要确保标识符的唯一性，避免与系统中其他内存标识符冲突；此外，应当遵循AUTOSAR标准中对于内存标识符的命名规范和数据类型要求；在实际应用中，还需考虑与ECU内存布局和诊断策略的兼容性。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00903</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>255</MAX>
                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                          <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:e98e6176-b3de-9222-5242-93f8dea1b6c6">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DemGroupOfDTC</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) for DTC groups.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemGroupOfDTC是用于定义故障诊断代码（DTC）的分组，使得可以对一组相关的DTC执行统一的操作，如重置或读取。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemGroupOfDTC时，确保每个DTC只属于一个分组，避免处理上的冲突；分组应根据故障诊断的逻辑和需求来设计，以便于管理和操作；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对DTC的分组和管理有详细规范，需要遵循这些规范以确保兼容性和一致性。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00679</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>65535</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:17f08587-b599-d33d-e2f4-0002267d640e">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DemGroupDTCs</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">DTC values of the selected group of DTC</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemGroupDTCs配置项用于定义一组诊断故障代码（DTCs），这些DTCs作为一个整体被管理和诊断，允许对多个相关故障进行统一处理。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemGroupDTCs时，确保每个DTC只属于一个组，避免处理上的冲突；组内的DTC应具有逻辑上的关联性，以便于统一管理和诊断；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准要求明确每个DTC组的属性和行为，确保诊断系统的一致性和可预测性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">(Range: 3 byte, 0xFFFFFF is reserved for 'all DTCs', according to ISO14229-1 Annex D.1) The DTC group 'all DTCs' is always available and will not be configured. The following ranges are reserved by ISO 14229-1 : 0x000000 to 0x0000ff and 0xffff00 to 0xffffff.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00678</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>16776959</MAX>
                                  <MIN>256</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                              </PARAMETERS>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                          </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                      </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:9a005bc7-bfcc-476f-a2fa-1152a1793b12">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemExtendedDataClass</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This class contains the combinations of extended data records for an extended data class.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemExtendedDataClass 配置项用于定义诊断事件的扩展数据记录类，这些数据用于存储额外的故障信息，以便于故障分析和诊断。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemExtendedDataClass时，必须确保其与DemExtendedDataRecord配置项兼容；每个诊断事件可以配置多个扩展数据类，但每个类的标识符必须唯一；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对扩展数据的大小和格式有严格规定，需要遵守这些规定以确保数据的正确性和系统的兼容性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00664</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>65535</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:76ed7707-7ef4-4a49-8502-1182d3997425">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemExtendedDataRecordClassRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This reference contains the link to an extended data class record.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemExtendedDataRecordClassRef 是一个配置项，用于引用扩展数据记录类，该类包含了用于故障诊断的额外数据。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemExtendedDataRecordClassRef时，需要确保引用的扩展数据记录类在系统中已定义且有效；此配置项通常与故障诊断需求紧密相关，因此应根据具体的诊断策略来配置；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保该引用符合标准的模块间引用机制。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00774</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>253</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
