                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dem/DemGeneral/DemExtendedDataRecordClass</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                      </REFERENCES>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:6821e454-6d75-4f8b-a6c1-c1e0fdc5f8d2">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemExtendedDataRecordClass</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) for an extended data record class.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemExtendedDataRecordClass 是用于定义诊断事件管理器（DEM）中扩展数据记录的属性和结构，它包含了用于存储额外故障信息的数据集合。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemExtendedDataRecordClass时，需要确保其数据大小不超过ECU的存储能力；每个扩展数据记录应有唯一的RecordNumber来标识；根据AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准，需要遵循定义的数据类型和结构。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">It is assembled out of one or several data elements.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00665</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>253</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2c092a02-741b-4363-b677-051dfa118690">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemExtendedDataRecordTrigger</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines the trigger to store the ExtendedDataRecord.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemExtendedDataRecordTrigger 是一个配置项，用于定义诊断事件扩展数据记录的触发条件，这些条件决定了何时记录额外的诊断信息。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保触发条件与诊断需求相符合；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中可能有特定的触发条件类型和限制，需要遵守这些规范；配置不当可能会导致不必要的数据记录或者遗漏重要的诊断信息。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">DEM_TRIGGER_ON_TEST_FAILED</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00804</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
