                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:221029aa-5a23-40f4-b9e0-b01c16eb1ecb">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemExtendedDataRecordUpdate</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This extended data record is captured if the configured trigger condition in &quot;DemExtendedDataRecordTrigger&quot; is fulfilled.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemExtendedDataRecordUpdate配置项用于定义诊断事件管理器（DEM）中扩展数据记录的更新策略，决定何时和如何更新与诊断事件相关的扩展数据。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，需要确保配置的更新策略符合系统的诊断需求；更新策略的选择会影响故障诊断的准确性和效率；在配置时要考虑与其他DEM配置参数的兼容性和整体诊断策略。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00621</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <LITERALS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:f5d11092-ac01-97db-579b-6138807cb61f">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DEM_UPDATE_RECORD_NO</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:88c4c861-7dc7-9965-4b19-d8cc4db6109a">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DEM_UPDATE_RECORD_YES</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                          </LITERALS>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a403cf7b-c80e-4d4b-9e39-5805c8992866">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemExtendedDataRecordNumber</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This configuration parameter specifies an unique identifier for an extended data record.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemExtendedDataRecordNumber 是用于定义诊断事件管理器（DEM）中扩展数据记录的唯一标识符，它指定了一个特定的扩展数据记录编号，用于存储与诊断事件相关的额外信息。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保每个扩展数据记录编号在整个系统中是唯一的；编号应遵循AUTOSAR规定的范围和格式；在设计时要注意与诊断事件的关联性和数据记录的存储策略。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">One or more extended data records can be assigned to one diagnostic event/DTC.

                                                0x00 is reserved by ISO (therefore the minimal value equals 1)

                                                0xF0 to 0xFF are reserved by ISO (therefore the maximal value equals 239)</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00666</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>239</MAX>
                          <MIN>1</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:97567e6b-f870-4e8a-ba55-b05cfd081266">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemDataElementClassRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This reference contains the link to a data element class.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDataElementClassRef 是一个配置项，用于引用数据元素类，该类定义了诊断事件管理器（DEM）中用于存储和报告诊断信息的数据元素的属性。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemDataElementClassRef时，必须确保引用的数据元素类已经在DEM配置中定义；引用的数据元素类应该与所需的诊断信息类型相匹配；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，数据元素类的定义应遵循规范的数据类型和结构要求。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00771</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
