                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:0dd242a0-90fd-4d71-9506-bcab60321bf8">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemFreezeFrameClass</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the combinations of DIDs for a non OBD2 and WWH-OBD relevant freeze frame class.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemFreezeFrameClass配置项用于定义诊断事件冻结帧的数据类，它指定了冻结帧中应包含的数据元素和格式，用于故障诊断和车辆维护。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemFreezeFrameClass时，需确保所选数据元素与诊断需求相匹配；冻结帧数据的大小和数量可能受到ECU存储能力的限制；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对冻结帧的数据元素和格式有明确规定，需遵守这些规定以保证兼容性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00673</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>65535</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:f641607d-0dcf-4d67-80a5-3fddd327023a">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemDidClassRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the DID elements which shall be contained in the freeze frame.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDidClassRef 是一个配置项，用于引用数据标识符类（DID Class），它定义了诊断事件管理器（DEM）中特定数据标识符（DID）的属性和行为。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemDidClassRef时，必须确保引用的DID类存在于DEM配置中；DID类的属性必须与相关的诊断需求相匹配；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，DID类的定义应遵循规范的模板和约束。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00707</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <REQUIRES-INDEX>true</REQUIRES-INDEX>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dem/DemGeneral/DemDidClass</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                      </REFERENCES>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:e2e5fbe0-d229-4de6-a9db-3c1d6cf37722">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemFreezeFrameRecNumClass</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains a list of dedicated, different freeze frame record numbers assigned to an event. The order of record numbers in this list is assigned to the chronological order of the according freeze frame records.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemFreezeFrameRecNumClass 配置项用于定义诊断事件的冻结帧记录数类别，它指定了每个诊断事件可以存储的冻结帧记录的最大数量。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemFreezeFrameRecNumClass时，需要确保为每个诊断事件分配的冻结帧记录数不超过ECU的存储能力；此外，该配置项的值应当符合诊断需求，既要满足故障信息足够的需求，也要考虑到存储空间的限制；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循相关的模块规范来配置该项，以保证诊断服务的正确实现。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00775</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>65535</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:0c808701-e72e-45ab-9efe-233c0ea65198">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemFreezeFrameRecordClassRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This parameter references record number(s) for a freeze frame record.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemFreezeFrameRecordClassRef 是一个配置项，用于引用冻结帧记录类，该类定义了与特定故障诊断监控相关的冻结帧数据集合。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemFreezeFrameRecordClassRef时，必须确保引用的冻结帧记录类已经在系统中定义；引用的类需要包含所有必要的数据元素，以便正确记录故障时的环境状态；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，冻结帧的数据结构和内容应遵循相关的诊断规范。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00800</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
