                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:b8f84dc2-a70a-4523-8c77-0cef2f837fbd">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemGeneralJ1939</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the general J1939-specific configuration (parameters) of the Dem module.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemGeneralJ1939配置项用于定义诊断事件管理（DEM）模块中与J1939协议相关的一般属性，这包括诊断信息的格式和行为，以及与J1939网络通信相关的参数设置。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用J1939协议的项目中，需要确保此配置与项目需求一致；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对J1939的支持可能有限，需要参考最新的AUTOSAR规范文档以获取详细信息；配置时需注意与其他诊断协议（如UDS）的兼容性和整合。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">If the container exists the J1939 support is enabled.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00864</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:006b1cb5-b415-4364-a2de-9716bb0336eb">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemJ1939ClearDtcSupport</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This configuration switch defines whether clearing J1939 DTCs (DM03 und DM11) is supported or not.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemJ1939ClearDtcSupport配置项用于定义诊断事件管理（DEM）模块是否支持J1939网络上的DTC清除功能，这是一种用于商用车辆的网络协议标准。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置此项时，需要确保系统中是否实际使用了J1939协议；若未使用J1939协议，则不应启用此功能；此外，该配置应与整车的诊断策略和法规要求相一致。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">This switches on and off the API Dem_J1939DcmClearDTC.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00872</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:12b38ba3-011d-436c-bc42-997b08968c93">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemJ1939Dm31Support</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This configuration switch defines whether J1939 DM31 is supported or not.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemJ1939Dm31Support配置项用于定义诊断事件管理（DEM）模块是否支持J1939协议的DM31消息，这是用于特定监控系统的性能信息传输。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用此配置项时，需要确保整个系统支持J1939协议；如果系统不使用J1939协议，则此配置项应设置为不支持；此配置项的使用可能需要根据具体项目需求和法规要求进行调整。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">This switches on and off the APIs Dem_J1939DcmFirstDTCwithLampStatus and Dem_J1939DcmGetNextDTCwithLampStatus.
                                                .</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00868</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:c3285bd5-b3d6-48de-a1a2-9d1e46424e94">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemJ1939ExpandedFreezeFrameSupport</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This configuration switch defines whether J1939 expanded freeze frames are supported or not.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemJ1939ExpandedFreezeFrameSupport配置项用于定义诊断事件管理（DEM）模块是否支持J1939扩展冻结帧数据的记录和存储，这是一种用于故障诊断的数据集合，包含故障发生时的各种运行参数。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用此配置项时，需要确保整个系统设计满足J1939协议的要求；此外，对于不使用J1939协议的项目，此配置项应设置为不支持或禁用状态；最后，开启此功能可能会增加ECU的存储和处理需求，需要在设计时考虑资源分配。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">This switches on and off the APIs Dem_J1939DcmSetFreezeFrameFilter, Dem_J1939DcmGetNextFreezeFrame and Dem_J1939DcmGetNextSPNInFreezeFrame.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00873</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:6cbd5bf9-7d09-474b-93ac-870ea2b2c62d">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemJ1939FreezeFrameSupport</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This configuration switch defines whether J1939 freeze frames are supported or not.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemJ1939FreezeFrameSupport配置项用于指定诊断事件管理（DEM）模块是否支持J1939冻结帧数据的记录和存储，这是与J1939协议相关的一种特定于车辆的诊断信息。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用此配置项时，需要确保系统中实现了J1939协议相关的功能；此配置项的启用可能会增加ECU的内存和处理需求；如果项目不涉及J1939协议或者不需要冻结帧功能，该配置项应设置为不支持以节省资源。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">This switches on and off the APIs Dem_J1939DcmSetFreezeFrameFilter and Dem_J1939DcmGetNextFreezeFrame.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00866</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:60ea9ba9-0c2d-4cb4-8a29-0ef5482137fe">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemJ1939RatioSupport</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This configuration switch defines whether J1939 performance ratios are supported or not.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemJ1939RatioSupport配置项用于定义诊断事件管理（DEM）模块是否支持J1939比率监控功能，这是一种特定于J1939协议的故障监控机制。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在非J1939项目中，此配置项应设置为不支持，以避免不必要的资源消耗；确保在启用此功能时，系统中已实现J1939通信协议相关模块；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中未明确定义此配置项，若使用需确保与具体项目需求和实现一致。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">This switches on and off the APIs Dem_J1939DcmSetRatioFilter and Dem_J1939DcmGetNextFilteredRatio.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00867</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
