                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:6f94320e-b403-48e1-9a7c-3c3c34518b32">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemJ1939Readiness3Support</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This configuration switch defines whether J1939 diagnostic readiness 3 is supported or not.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemJ1939Readiness3Support配置项用于指定诊断事件管理（DEM）模块是否支持J1939协议中定义的Readiness3监控功能，该功能涉及到特定的排放相关监控状态报告。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemJ1939Readiness3Support时，需要确保车辆的诊断系统与J1939排放监控要求兼容；如果车辆不使用J1939协议或不需要满足相关排放监控标准，则可以禁用此功能以节省资源；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于J1939相关功能的支持可能受限，需要根据最新的AUTOSAR规范和实施指南进行检查和配置。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">This switches on and off the API Dem_J1939DcmReadDiagnosticReadiness3.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00871</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
