                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:fd5a0bb6-54d2-4124-85b4-316cc364f4f3">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemOBDCentralizedPID31Handling</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Switch to enable the centralized handling of PID $31.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemOBDCentralizedPID31Handling是一个配置项，用于定义诊断事件管理器（DEM）是否集中处理OBD（车载诊断）的PID（参数标识符）31，即请求动力总成冻结帧数据。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，此配置项应当与车辆的OBD要求相匹配；如果车辆需要支持OBD冻结帧，则应启用此功能；配置时应确保与其他OBD相关配置项协同工作。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">true: centralized handling of PID $31 enabled

                                                false: centralized handling of PID $31 disabled</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00879</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:cf71ce0b-b730-4254-83e0-15f3ffcaf8f6">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemOBDDelayedDCYConfirmedAndMIL</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Controls the delayed calculation of the confirmed status for the OBD driving cycle.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemOBDDelayedDCYConfirmedAndMIL是用于定义在车辆OBD（On-Board Diagnostics）系统中，故障指示灯（MIL, Malfunction Indicator Lamp）确认后延迟的驾驶循环数的配置项。它指定了在确认故障后，需要经过多少个驾驶循环才能清除MIL的显示。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意事项：该配置项的值需要根据具体的法规要求和车辆制造商的策略来设定；过高或过低的设置可能会影响到车辆的故障诊断系统的性能和合规性；在AUTOSAR环境中，确保该配置与其他诊断配置项协同工作，避免配置冲突。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00917</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2b92632d-3dbf-4fc6-b488-3786c582eb80">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemOBDEventDisplacement</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Activate/Deactivate a different displacement behavior for OBD events.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemOBDEventDisplacement 配置项用于定义在OBD（On-Board Diagnostics）相关的故障诊断管理中，当故障事件存储空间不足时，用于确定哪些故障事件应该被替换或移位的策略。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemOBDEventDisplacement时，需要确保遵循OBD要求，以及相关的法规和标准；此配置项对于满足排放相关的诊断要求尤为重要；在设计替换策略时，应考虑故障事件的优先级和排放影响，以确保关键故障事件不会被错误地替换。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">OBD events with special Conditions (e.g. Pending, MIL_On...) shall not be displaced.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00796</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:058de33b-9613-4914-8cad-aa16dd234b1e">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemOBDEngineType</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Switch to provide either Gasoline or Diesel parameters.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemOBDEngineType配置项用于定义车辆中使用的OBD（On-Board Diagnostics）发动机类型，这是用于故障诊断系统中，以满足特定的排放监控要求。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemOBDEngineType时，需要确保选择的发动机类型符合车辆实际情况及相关的排放法规要求；AUTOSAR标准中可能会定义一系列预设的发动机类型枚举值，需要从中选择合适的值；如果项目中涉及到多种发动机类型，需要为每种发动机类型配置相应的DemOBDEngineType。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00900</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
