                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:cfcbf5d3-1309-4a84-ac7c-247c321b34f1">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemOBDCompliancy</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Configuration value to define  the appropriate value to PID$1C &quot;OBD requirements to which vehicle or engine is certified.&quot; according to the respective standards, e.g. OBD, OBDII, JOBD etc.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemOBDCompliancy配置项用于指定诊断事件管理（DEM）模块是否遵循OBD（On-Board Diagnostics）标准，以及遵循的具体标准版本。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemOBDCompliancy时，必须确保选择的OBD标准版本与车辆所在地区的法规相匹配；若项目不涉及OBD要求，则应选择非OBD选项；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，确保与其他诊断配置项的兼容性和一致性。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">Notice as well J1979 or the &quot;DiagnosticReadiness 1&quot; DM05 message of J1939-73</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00795</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
