                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/NvM/NvMBlockDescriptor</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                      </REFERENCES>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:edf2c803-842d-44ee-91cf-76c67f209935">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemOperationCycle</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container holds all parameters that are relevant to configure an operation cycle.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemOperationCycle配置项用于定义诊断事件管理（DEM）中的操作周期，它指定了诊断监控周期的开始和结束，是诊断信息有效性和状态转换的基础。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：操作周期的定义必须与实际车辆操作状态紧密相关，以确保诊断信息的准确性和及时性；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，每个DemEventParameter必须关联至少一个DemOperationCycle；操作周期的管理应遵循AUTOSAR的规范，确保其在系统重启或特定条件下正确初始化和终止。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00701</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>256</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:99ec8223-f61d-498a-b636-fdd2b87159a9">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemOperationCycleAutostart</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">The autostart property defines if the operation cycles is automatically (re-)started during Dem_PreInit.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemOperationCycleAutostart配置项用于定义诊断操作周期是否在系统启动时自动开始，这有助于在系统启动时立即启动诊断监控。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR 4.4中，确保此配置与系统的实际需求相匹配，以避免不必要的诊断活动；此配置项对于节能和快速启动策略的实现尤为重要；配置错误可能导致在系统启动时未能按预期执行诊断监控。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00805</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:0f954275-b8ea-4b72-8db7-11445e07943a">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemOperationCycleId</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This parameter's value is used, together with the aggregating container, to define a symbolic name of the operation cycle.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemOperationCycleId 用于标识诊断事件管理（DEM）中的操作周期，这是一个用于追踪和管理车辆操作状态的关键参数。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保每个DemOperationCycleId与特定的操作周期唯一对应；操作周期的定义应符合系统的诊断需求；在配置时需遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对操作周期的具体要求和规范。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00898</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>255</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:cd8d578d-8895-4bc2-a8d3-e8ffeaaf75cc">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemLeadingCycleRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines the operation cycle, which is relevant for processing this operation cycle.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemLeadingCycleRef 是一个配置项，用于引用诊断事件管理（DEM）中的操作周期，该周期作为事件发生和状态变化的主导周期。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemLeadingCycleRef时，需要确保引用的操作周期已在系统中定义；主导周期的选择应与事件的行为和要求相匹配；在配置多个事件时，注意不同事件可能共享相同的主导周期，这可能会影响事件的管理和诊断策略。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
