                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:5b7f3369-b175-4235-bd33-5f46fe1078d9">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemRatioKind</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines whether the ratio will be calculated API or observer based.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemRatioKind是一个配置项，用于定义诊断事件管理（DEM）中比率监控的类型，例如故障频率或者故障恢复的比率。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保DemRatioKind的值符合预定义的枚举类型；该配置项通常与特定的监控策略和故障处理逻辑相关联；在配置时应考虑系统的诊断需求和合规性要求。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00741</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <LITERALS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:0f28b897-c6c4-8505-4063-4ea05dc5ff9d">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DEM_RATIO_API</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:91f98f41-6f70-86df-49f0-d49d5dcd5199">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DEM_RATIO_OBSERVER</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                          </LITERALS>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:25cf98a3-6dce-490d-a2f1-8a73b51507ad">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemRatioId</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines a unique ratio Id.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemRatioId 是用于标识诊断事件管理（Diagnostic Event Manager, DEM）中比率监控计数器的唯一标识符。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemRatioId时，必须确保其唯一性，以避免在DEM中的比率监控计数器之间发生冲突；此外，该标识符通常与特定的监控比率事件相关联，因此需要确保正确映射到相应的诊断事件；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应遵循相关规范来配置和使用DemRatioId。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">This parameter should not be changeable by user, because the Id should be generated by Dem itself to prevent gaps and multiple use of an Id. The ratio Ids should be sequentially ordered beginning with 0 and no gaps in between.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00787</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>65535</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:e4a17661-b438-44c2-b250-9d97e9cda20d">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemDiagnosticEventRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This reference contains the link to a diagnostic event.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemDiagnosticEventRef是一个配置项，用于将诊断事件（Diagnostic Event）与其他诊断配置元素（如DTC，诊断故障码）关联起来，确保诊断系统能够准确识别和处理特定的事件。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保每个诊断事件唯一对应一个DemDiagnosticEventRef，避免诊断事件处理的混乱；该配置项的正确设置对于故障检测和报告至关重要；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对诊断事件的管理和配置有详细规定，需要严格遵守以保证系统的兼容性和可靠性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00735</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dem/DemConfigSet/DemEventParameter</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:36c5505e-2322-474d-8979-f5ca259d394d">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemFunctionIdRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This reference contains the link to a function identifier within the FiM which is used as a primary FID.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemFunctionIdRef 是一个配置项，用于引用诊断事件管理（DEM）中的函数标识符，该标识符用于将特定的诊断功能与其实现关联起来。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemFunctionIdRef时，必须确保引用的函数标识符在DEM配置中是唯一的；引用的函数必须已经在DEM中定义，以确保正确的诊断功能关联；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应遵循DEM模块的配置规则和约束。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00736</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/FiM/FiMConfigSet/FiMFID</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                      </REFERENCES>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:5f232bac-fe27-4d30-b072-1795f9af7ef6">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemStorageCondition</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) for storage conditions.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemStorageCondition配置项用于定义诊断事件管理（DEM）中的存储条件，它指定了在何种条件下诊断事件可以被存储到非易失性存储器中。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemStorageCondition时，需要确保其与诊断事件的触发条件相匹配；此外，应当考虑存储条件对系统内存和性能的影响；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中可能有特定的属性和参数要求，需要遵循标准以确保兼容性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00728</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:57bb12c8-1d23-4314-a9fa-d0cb5116322f">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemStorageConditionStatus</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines the initial status for enable or disable of storage of a diagnostic event.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemStorageConditionStatus是用于定义诊断事件管理（DEM）中存储条件的状态，它决定了在特定条件下是否允许存储诊断事件。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemStorageConditionStatus时，需要确保其与诊断需求和系统行为一致；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中可能受限于特定的DEM模块配置选项；正确配置此项对于避免不必要的诊断信息存储或丢失重要诊断信息至关重要。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">The value is the initialization after power up (before this condition is reported the first time).
                                                true: storage of a diagnostic event enabled
                                                false: storage of a diagnostic event disabled</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00731</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>true</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:67e309bf-b4b9-4de5-b0d1-47df01d36b84">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemStorageConditionId</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines a unique storage condition Id. This parameter should not be changeable by user, because the Id should be generated by Dem itself to prevent gaps and multiple use of an Id. The storage conditions should be sequentially ordered beginning with 0 and no gaps in between.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemStorageConditionId是用于标识诊断事件管理（DEM）中特定存储条件的唯一标识符，它关联到特定的诊断事件，以控制该事件的存储逻辑。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemStorageConditionId时，必须确保其唯一性，避免与其他存储条件标识符冲突；该标识符通常与特定的存储条件逻辑相关联，因此在设计时需要考虑其与事件存储逻辑的一致性；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对于DemStorageConditionId的使用和配置应遵循DEM模块的规范要求。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00730</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>255</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:d8267d19-646d-4da5-af64-7f15222f4095">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemStorageConditionReplacementEventRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Specifies the reference to an event which is stored to event memory and supports failure analysis.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemStorageConditionReplacementEventRef用于引用一个特定的诊断事件，该事件将在原始诊断事件的存储条件不满足时被记录替代。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保引用的诊断事件已在系统中定义且有效；替代事件的配置应支持原始事件的诊断需求；在配置时需考虑事件替代对故障诊断和报告的影响。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00893</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC V1.0.0</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dem/DemConfigSet/DemEventParameter</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                      </REFERENCES>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:713b95f5-b501-4a30-91c8-cedbe4ba692b">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DemStorageConditionGroup</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) for storage condition groups.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemStorageConditionGroup 是用于定义诊断事件管理（DEM）中的存储条件组，这些条件决定了何时可以存储或更新特定的诊断事件。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保每个存储条件组的配置与实际的系统需求和诊断策略相匹配；在配置存储条件时，应详细考虑系统的性能和资源限制；存储条件应清晰地反映出诊断需求和优先级。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00773</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:94a93959-aae2-416d-a59a-bd0fae591f32">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemStorageConditionRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">References an enable condition.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DemStorageConditionRef是一个配置项，用于引用存储条件，这些条件决定了诊断事件管理（DEM）中特定诊断事件是否应该被存储。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DemStorageConditionRef时，必须确保引用的存储条件已经定义在系统中；此配置项对于实现基于条件的诊断事件存储机制至关重要；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保存储条件与诊断事件之间的映射正确无误是必要的。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00768</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
